And yesterday I already talked about it.

42
00:04:07.418 --> 00:04:10.418
A piece of the prophetic timeline in which God speaks.

43
00:04:13.418 --> 00:04:14.418
And it is directional.

44
00:04:26.418 --> 00:04:29.418
And that is also a kind of overview of the future.

45
00:04:29.418 --> 00:04:30.418
And it is directional.

46
00:04:34.418 --> 00:04:36.418
And it revolves around preparation.

47
00:04:46.418 --> 00:04:52.418
And everything that is happening has a direction behind it in which the Lord is on the way.

48
00:04:59.418 --> 00:05:02.418
These are a number of years that are very strategic.

49
00:05:09.418 --> 00:05:16.418
And it is a very strategic time in which the Lord establishes His house of prayer.

50
00:05:21.418 --> 00:05:24.418
So that when difficulties increase,

51
00:05:25.418 --> 00:05:28.418
the house of God is established.

52
