And you can also see that reflected in the psalms and it is applied very practically there.

53
00:05:45.418 --> 00:05:52.418
But the idea is this, that in the midst of chaos there is a house and there is the presence of God.

54
00:05:55.418 --> 00:05:56.418
It is very loud.

55
00:05:57.418 --> 00:06:00.418
For me it is very loud, but I don't know if it is different for everyone.

56
00:06:01.418 --> 00:06:08.418
And so the idea is that when the nations are touched,

57
00:06:08.418 --> 00:06:14.418
when spiritual warfare intensifies, and that is happening.

58
00:06:15.418 --> 00:06:19.418
At that moment the Lord sets His house as the highest place

59
00:06:19.418 --> 00:06:23.418
and says, nothing that happens on earth will surpass my house.

60
00:06:29.418 --> 00:06:31.418
And that is very important.

61
00:06:33.418 --> 00:06:34.418
And that is very important.

62
00:06:36.418 --> 00:06:37.418
And that is very important.

63
00:06:37.418 --> 00:06:40.418
Nothing that happens on earth will surpass my house.

64
00:06:54.418 --> 00:06:58.418
And why are we so passionate about that now?

65
00:06:58.418 --> 00:07:02.418
For there has always been worship, there has always been prayer.

66
00:07:02.418 --> 00:07:05.418
And always a love for the Word, but why now?

67
00:07:07.418 --> 00:07:21.418
And there has been a shift in that timeline.

68
00:07:21.418 --> 00:07:24.418
And there is now an urgency behind it.

69
00:07:24.418 --> 00:07:27.418
Now is the moment to prepare yourself for the coming of the Lord.

70
00:07:27.418 --> 00:07:39.418
And at the beginning of 2021, I also woke up with that.

71
00:07:39.418 --> 00:07:42.418
We are preparing for the wedding of the Lamb.

72
00:07:42.418 --> 00:07:52.418
And that comes from Revelation 19 and you can read that at your own pace.

73
00:07:52.418 --> 00:07:53.418
I will not go into that deeply now.

74
00:07:53.418 --> 00:08:08.418
But what is important is this.

75
00:08:08.418 --> 00:08:16.418
That which underlies everything we do and that overarching idea is that He is coming.

76
00:08:16.418 --> 00:08:33.418
So that is the light in which we live.

77
00:08:33.418 --> 00:08:39.418
We know that He is coming, we see that He will come, and so we organize our lives with that sense of urgency.

78
00:08:40.418 --> 00:08:48.418
And why is this on His heart?

79
00:08:48.418 --> 00:08:53.418
He longs for it and we need it.

80
00:08:53.418 --> 00:08:59.418
I can't say it simpler than that.

81
00:08:59.418 --> 00:09:03.418
He longs for it and we need it.

82
00:09:03.418 --> 00:09:09.418
Write that down.

83
00:09:09.418 --> 00:09:13.418
Jesus wants and desires that His people be a house of prayer.

84
00:09:13.418 --> 00:09:16.418
And we need it.

85
00:09:16.418 --> 00:09:22.418
We need it so much to be a people of prayer.

86
00:09:22.418 --> 00:09:46.418
And what I believe will happen is that the word prayer will experience a refreshing, a new revelation of what prayer is and can be.

87
00:09:46.418 --> 00:09:53.418
That it is no longer for a small group.

88
00:09:53.418 --> 00:09:56.418
In a little room somewhere far away.

89
00:09:56.418 --> 00:10:06.418
Or a number of mothers who pray very faithfully. It will no longer just be that.

90
00:10:07.418 --> 00:10:19.418
And I am not saying that will disappear, but what I am saying is that more will come forth than just that.

91
00:10:20.418 --> 00:10:26.418
This does not replace all other forms of prayer.

92
00:10:27.418 --> 00:10:30.418
This is not a...

93
00:10:31.418 --> 00:10:33.418
It is not...

94
00:10:46.418 --> 00:10:59.418
And this does not replace all other forms of prayer, but making the Lord great together and being in prayer together in such a way that the whole church is involved, that is what the Lord longs for.

95
00:11:00.418 --> 00:11:02.418
And there is an anointing on that.

96
00:11:03.418 --> 00:11:07.418
And that means His presence is there.

97
00:11:08.418 --> 00:11:12.418
He longs for it and He loves to be in it.

98
00:11:12.418 --> 00:11:36.418
And why this form, Vanessa? Yes, I don't know either, but I know when I read the Bible that He longs for it so much and that He loves to not dwell somewhere in a building, but among the people, with people.

99
00:11:36.418 --> 00:11:47.418
And that is the answer, from the beginning to the end God says, I want to be with you.

100
00:11:53.418 --> 00:11:59.418
From Genesis to Revelation, the storyline is always that God lives with His people.

101
00:12:06.418 --> 00:12:28.418
And I believe that He has drawn the attention of leaders and that thereby the whole people can be lifted up, as it were.

102
00:12:31.418 --> 00:12:34.418
This is a place where He will rest.

103
00:12:37.418 --> 00:12:40.418
It is a place where He likes to dwell.

104
00:12:49.418 --> 00:12:56.418
But not in the measure as we have known it. I truly believe it will be full of glory.

105
00:12:58.418 --> 00:13:00.418
And we have already encountered a part.

106
00:13:06.418 --> 00:13:20.418
And the Word promises that the last days will be greater than the earlier days and we are continually living in those later days.

107
00:13:20.418 --> 00:13:37.418
And I said that yesterday as well, but a year of revival is nothing at all without Jesus at the center.

108
00:13:37.418 --> 00:13:55.418
And when we sing that song, Lord, send revival, as you have shown in the past, do it again. That line touches me.

109
00:13:55.418 --> 00:14:09.418
And if you look at the great revivals, where did they emerge and how did they hold on to it?

110
00:14:12.418 --> 00:14:16.418
It was a people, a group of people who surrendered to prayer.

111
00:14:19.418 --> 00:14:21.418
For prayer is about someone.

112
00:14:22.418 --> 00:14:24.418
It is not about a list.

113
00:14:25.418 --> 00:14:27.418
It is about being with Him.

114
00:14:39.418 --> 00:14:49.418
And this is the change we are going to see. When you come to pray, it is not about a list and I must pray for this and pray for that and my big toe and oh this and oh that.

115
00:14:52.418 --> 00:14:54.418
It is much more this.

116
00:14:55.418 --> 00:15:02.418
It is much more about settling the soul and the chaos in God first.

117
00:15:09.418 --> 00:15:19.418
It is much more about communion through the Spirit with God.

118
00:15:26.418 --> 00:15:28.418
It is about family, family. It is all good.

119
00:15:30.418 --> 00:15:39.418
So you saw that with all those changes, if you read about changes, then the presence of God would completely fill the streets.

120
00:15:40.418 --> 00:15:44.418
People should not have to say anything, people would only find themselves in the church.

121
00:15:44.418 --> 00:15:59.418
And when you read about the great revivals, the presence of God was so strong in the streets that people didn't need to go outside to tell it, but people felt drawn and found themselves in a church.

122
00:16:03.418 --> 00:16:11.418
So when we focus on that one thing, all other things are attached to it.

123
00:16:14.418 --> 00:16:34.418
If you neglect to love Him first, then you can forget about the whole revival. Therefore, it is about loving the Lord God Himself first, that is the first commandment.

124
00:16:45.418 --> 00:16:59.418
And He really does not go against His Word. He does not allow you to be trying all sorts of things in whatever power that has nothing to do with Him. He comes at the moment we first love Him and put Him at the center.

125
00:16:59.418 --> 00:17:14.418
Jesus speaks of a day when the pressure increases and the glory also increases.

126
00:17:14.418 --> 00:17:21.418
And the glory will be upon the people and upon Him.

127
00:17:31.418 --> 00:17:38.418
And that does not come just like that, it comes at the moment we have learned how to be with God Himself, that we have learned in prayer.

128
00:17:44.418 --> 00:18:04.418
And it is just a brief introduction, but that overarching idea can be found throughout the whole Bible. God desires a resting place with people.

129
00:18:05.418 --> 00:18:12.418
And He comes to a people who set themselves to that.

130
00:18:15.418 --> 00:18:18.418
And the second thing is that we need it ourselves.

131
00:18:19.418 --> 00:18:43.418
Jesus knows that the only way we can gain victory over the dynamics on earth is by being deeply rooted in Him, in that unity.

132
00:18:43.418 --> 00:18:50.418
You will not stand in any other way.

133
00:18:53.418 --> 00:18:55.418
It is not popular.

134
00:18:55.418 --> 00:18:56.418
It is not popular.

135
00:19:09.418 --> 00:19:17.418
It requires a change in our routine, that we really set aside time to be with the Lord.

136
00:19:17.418 --> 00:19:27.418
But He knows that the only way to stand is with Him.

137
00:19:32.418 --> 00:19:40.418
In communion with Him through the Spirit and with others in a collective worship environment.

138
00:19:47.418 --> 00:19:52.418
You can see that, for example, in Matthew 24 and 25 and Luke 21.

139
00:19:59.418 --> 00:20:04.418
And Jesus speaks here about what is to come. What birth pains can you see?

140
00:20:08.418 --> 00:20:10.418
And then you have John 13 to 17.

141
00:20:18.418 --> 00:20:23.418
And you see that He is going to describe how the days will look before He returns.

142
00:20:31.418 --> 00:20:37.418
And that is interesting, because you see so many tensions and we are still only at the beginning.

143
00:20:38.418 --> 00:20:55.418
And the only instruction He gives to the disciples at that moment is to watch and pray.

144
00:20:59.418 --> 00:21:01.418
Observe and pray.

145
00:21:03.418 --> 00:21:04.418
That is all He says.

146
00:21:07.418 --> 00:21:12.418
Go away into a cave, hopefully you'll get through it.

147
00:21:12.418 --> 00:21:17.418
No, look what happens, what I said would happen, look what happens.

148
00:21:17.418 --> 00:21:24.418
He does not say go buy all the toilet paper or hide yourself away in a cave somewhere.

149
00:21:24.418 --> 00:21:27.418
He says no, watch and observe.

150
00:21:29.418 --> 00:21:31.418
See how the plagues come.

151
00:21:34.418 --> 00:21:36.418
See how everything comes over the earth.

152
00:21:38.418 --> 00:21:46.418
And not in a small place you have never heard of, but the whole earth at once.

153
00:21:53.418 --> 00:21:57.418
As disciples we have the winning hand.

154
00:21:59.418 --> 00:22:00.418
We know what is coming.

155
00:22:02.418 --> 00:22:03.418
If we dive into it.

156
00:22:07.418 --> 00:22:11.418
He prepares us, He is also the prophet, He tells us what will come.

157
00:22:15.418 --> 00:22:20.418
So He says look, pay attention to how that which I said would come also comes.

158
00:22:26.418 --> 00:22:31.418
And He also says do not be afraid of it, do not worry about it.

159
00:22:38.418 --> 00:22:44.418
He says to us, you know that this is going to come, so do not worry about it.

160
00:22:45.418 --> 00:22:46.418
Do you see that?

161
00:22:51.418 --> 00:22:55.418
And your response is to pray, to be with me.

162
00:22:55.418 --> 00:23:04.418
Your response is not to get sucked into the unrest around you, but your response is to be with other Christians in the house of God and to worship with your whole heart.

163
00:23:17.418 --> 00:23:19.418
It is to rise above all the noise.

164
00:23:21.418 --> 00:23:22.418
This is what we live for.

165
00:23:25.418 --> 00:23:27.418
Not to participate in the chaos.

166
00:23:33.418 --> 00:23:38.418
But to be a lampstand, to be a witness.

167
00:23:42.418 --> 00:23:45.418
To be a witness for a world that no longer knows what it is almost doing.

168
00:23:45.418 --> 00:23:55.418
Do you see how practical and how simple it is?

169
00:23:56.418 --> 00:24:05.418
And there are other things, but the essence of what we must do is simply to come together regularly and to live in that community with God.

170
00:24:06.418 --> 00:24:12.418
To be in the Word and to be touched in many ways by His presence in the Word.

171
00:24:15.418 --> 00:24:17.418
And Jesus Himself lived that life.

172
00:24:20.418 --> 00:24:22.418
And that is how Jesus Himself lived.

173
00:24:27.418 --> 00:24:29.418
And that is how Jesus Himself lived.

174
00:24:29.418 --> 00:24:31.418
And that is how Jesus Himself lived.

175
00:24:37.418 --> 00:24:39.418
And that is how He could go to the cross.

176
00:24:45.418 --> 00:24:47.418
That is how He got through it.

177
00:24:50.418 --> 00:24:56.418
That is how He could achieve victory, because He was in constant communion with God.

178
00:25:00.418 --> 00:25:02.418
And that is how Jesus Himself lived.

179
00:25:06.418 --> 00:25:08.418
And that is how Jesus Himself lived.

180
00:25:13.418 --> 00:25:21.418
Try that exercise for yourself and go through the gospel and see how often it says that Jesus withdrew to pray.

181
00:25:21.418 --> 00:25:25.418
That He was in a lonely place to pray.

182
00:25:25.418 --> 00:25:30.418
That He went to the mountain to pray, that He withdrew after being with the crowd.

183
00:25:38.418 --> 00:25:47.418
And it also often says, and He was constantly in the temple. He taught, He was there with the leaders. It is a whole life.

184
00:25:48.418 --> 00:25:57.418
So He desires a house, a place to live with His people.

185
00:25:59.418 --> 00:26:01.418
And we need it.

186
00:26:03.418 --> 00:26:04.418
We must have it.

187
00:26:05.418 --> 00:26:08.418
We absolutely need Him.

188
00:26:08.418 --> 00:26:20.418
If you look at the gospel of Luke in Luke 21,

189
00:26:39.418 --> 00:26:45.418
And in Luke, He also gives a warning to listen, that pressure can be so great on you.

190
00:26:45.418 --> 00:26:51.418
Do not seek relief in other places where you have nothing to look for, in drunkenness for example.

191
00:26:52.418 --> 00:26:54.418
He uses the word dissipation.

192
00:27:04.418 --> 00:27:10.418
Beware that your heart is not weighed down by anxiety.

193
00:27:21.418 --> 00:27:36.418
He says, the temptation will be to deal with that pressure by seeking all kinds of excess and pleasures here in the world.

194
00:27:37.418 --> 00:27:39.418
In alcohol.

195
00:27:48.418 --> 00:27:54.418
In things that seem to bring rest to your soul, which provide a temporary distraction.

196
00:27:54.418 --> 00:27:58.418
Do not reach for that, but seek your rest in the house of the Lord.

197
00:28:01.418 --> 00:28:04.418
Do you see how practical it actually is?

198
00:28:07.418 --> 00:28:14.418
Prayer is not something very ethereal, but prayer will help you resist the temptation of drunkenness.

199
00:28:29.418 --> 00:28:33.418
It will save people from giving themselves over to sexual impurity.

200
00:28:37.418 --> 00:28:43.418
People will need to be delivered from things in which they are stuck.

201
00:28:43.418 --> 00:28:48.418
God says, I will make you executed from those things through my oversight.

202
00:28:59.418 --> 00:29:02.418
People have already been stressed by the last two years.

203
00:29:02.418 --> 00:29:05.418
People already feel hopefully.

204
00:29:06.418 --> 00:29:10.418
The last two years have already caused a lot of stress.

205
00:29:10.418 --> 00:29:13.418
And there are already people who have given up hope.

206
00:29:21.418 --> 00:29:25.418
People are seeking security in their loneliness.

207
00:29:25.418 --> 00:29:28.418
Searching for the feeling of being loved.

208
00:29:33.418 --> 00:29:34.418
And that is the world.

209
00:29:34.418 --> 00:29:39.418
And now imagine if the church also steps into those temptations.

210
00:29:42.418 --> 00:29:44.418
And if there is no house of prayer.

211
00:29:51.418 --> 00:29:54.418
And we all calm ourselves in all sorts of other ways.

212
00:29:54.418 --> 00:29:57.418
But then He says, do not do that, for there is my glory.

213
00:29:58.418 --> 00:30:08.418
So if you feel tempted, go to the prayer meeting.

214
00:30:11.418 --> 00:30:13.418
It is so practical what He says here.

215
00:30:14.418 --> 00:30:17.418
If you feel that pressure and if you are worried.

216
00:30:17.418 --> 00:30:20.418
And if you think, maybe I will lose my job next week.

217
00:30:20.418 --> 00:30:22.418
Go to that presence of God.

218
00:30:32.418 --> 00:30:35.418
That is why He says, do it now, church.

219
00:30:35.418 --> 00:30:40.418
Build that routine, build this up now, before it gets too busy.

220
00:30:43.418 --> 00:30:46.418
For you make bad choices, even as disciples.

221
00:30:46.418 --> 00:30:49.418
We make bad choices if this is not a set rhythm.

222
00:30:49.418 --> 00:30:51.418
This is my heart, this is the way I will go.

223
00:30:51.418 --> 00:30:52.418
I am going to the house of prayer.

224
00:30:52.418 --> 00:30:55.418
I don't feel good, but I am still going to the house of prayer.

225
00:31:03.418 --> 00:31:05.418
Especially when we have had a hard time.

226
00:31:05.418 --> 00:31:06.418
Go to the house of prayer.

227
00:31:06.418 --> 00:31:08.418
Lie on your face for everyone who can.

228
00:31:08.418 --> 00:31:10.418
Enter into His presence.

229
00:31:13.418 --> 00:31:16.418
